GHOSTERAMA is released under the Zero-Clause BSD license (0BSD): no
attribution, no notice preservation, no conditions. It was PELLETINO 1.0 and
is licensed the same way as the rest of PELLETINO.

That covers the code written for this project: everything under main/,
tools/ and components/, with three exceptions:

  * components/z80_cpu/src/ holds Marat Fayzullin's Z80 emulator when you
    build it. Those files are not in this repository (they are gitignored;
    only the wrapper z80_cpu.c is ours). They are free for non-commercial use
    only, so a flashed GHOSTERAMA image may be shared but not sold.
  * components/pacman_hw/src/pacman_hw.cpp, pacman_video.cpp,
    components/audio_hal/src/namco_wsg.cpp and tools/convert_roms.py credit
    Till Harbaum's Galagino as their source. Galagino publishes no license.
    See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md; those files are not covered by this grant
    until that is settled.
  * The game ROMs, the medal's Pac-Man likeness (model/, photos/) and the
    Fiesta insert artwork are not licensed by this project. Pac-Man and its
    characters belong to Bandai Namco; the photos and models are here as
    documentation of the build, not for reuse.

